 "notes": "Answers: owners, their addresses and percentages are three lines read row by row (one per line, same order), and likewise the officers, their addresses and titles. plan_status takes the file or license number after the colon. sales_tax 'Exempt' ticks the exempt box. mailing 'Same as main address' picks Section 6; any address picks 'use below address' and fills Section 8. lodging 'Yes, name, license number' fills the lodging lines. 'None' leaves an optional line blank. The SSN box in Section 4 and the owners' and officers' SSN columns are never filled by Placetta; the seat counts for culinary education programs, vending serial numbers and cart counts, the signature and the date are left for the applicant.",
